<div id="visionModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-content"><span class="close" onclick="closeModal('visionModal')">&times;</span><h2>My Vision</h2><p>KitabVerse is my dream to make knowledge free for everyone — Including those who cannot see. A library for all — Read, Share, Connect, Listen, Touch (Braille), Speak (Alexa). No language barrier — All Indian + International + Voice + Braille + Alexa — One platform for ALL readers.</p><div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px"><button onclick="speakText(document.querySelector('#visionModal p').innerText)" style="flex:1;background:#d4af37;border:none;padding:8px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700">🔊 Speak Vision</button><button onclick="convertToBraille(document.querySelector('#visionModal p').innerText);openModal('brailleModal')" style="flex:1;background:#070c1e;border:1px solid #d4af37;color:#d4af37;padding:8px;border-radius:10px">⠃ Braille</button></div></div></div>
<div id="voiceModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-content"><span class="close" onclick="closeModal('voiceModal')">&times;</span><h2>🎙 Voice Search - All Indian & International</h2><p style="font-size:11px;opacity:.7">Admin Secured - Searches only from secured site</p><select id="voiceLang" style="width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:#070c1e;color:#fff;border:1px solid #333;margin-top:10px"><optgroup label="🇮🇳 INDIAN"><option value="en-IN">English India</option><option value="hi-IN">Hindi - हिंदी</option><option value="mr-IN">Marathi - मराठी</option><option value="kn-IN">Kannada - ಕನ್ನಡ</option><option value="ta-IN">Tamil</option><option value="te-IN">Telugu</option><option value="bn-IN">Bengali</option><option value="gu-IN">Gujarati</option><option value="ml-IN">Malayalam</option><option value="pa-IN">Punjabi</option><option value="ur-IN">Urdu</option><option value="or-IN">Odia</option><option value="kn-IN">Tulu</option></optgroup><optgroup label="🌍 INTERNATIONAL"><option value="en-US">English US</option><option value="en-GB">English UK</option><option value="es-ES">Spanish</option><option value="fr-FR">French</option><option value="de-DE">German</option><option value="it-IT">Italian</option><option value="pt-BR">Portuguese</option><option value="ru-RU">Russian</option><option value="ja-JP">Japanese</option><option value="ko-KR">Korean</option><option value="zh-CN">Chinese</option><option value="ar-SA">Arabic</option></optgroup></select><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:16px"><button id="voiceStartBtn" onclick="startVoice()" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d4af37,#f4d35e);border:none;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:24px;font-weight:800">🎙 Start Speaking</button><div id="voiceAnim" style="display:none;margin-top:12px"><div style="width:50px;height:50px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:50%;background:#d4af37;animation:pulse 1s infinite"></div></div><p id="voiceStatus" style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px"></p><p id="voiceResult" style="margin-top:8px;color:#d4af37"></p></div></div></div>
<div id="brailleModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-content"><span class="close" onclick="closeModal('brailleModal')">&times;</span><h2>⠃ Braille Mode</h2><textarea id="brailleInput" placeholder="Type anything..." style="width:100%;height:80px;margin-top:12px;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:#070c1e;color:#fff;border:1px solid #333"></textarea><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px"><button onclick="convertToBraille(document.getElementById('brailleInput').value)" style="flex:1;background:#d4af37;border:none;color:#000;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700">⠃ Convert</button><button onclick="speakText(document.getElementById('brailleInput').value)" style="flex:1;background:#070c1e;border:1px solid #d4af37;color:#d4af37;padding:10px;border-radius:10px">🔊 Speak</button></div><div id="brailleOutput" style="margin-top:14px;padding:12px;background:#000;border:1px solid #d4af37;border-radius:10px;font-size:22px;min-height:60px;word-break:break-all">⠅⠊⠞⠁⠃⠧⠑⠗⠎⠑</div></div></div>
<div id="alexaModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-content"><span class="close" onclick="closeModal('alexaModal')">&times;</span><h2>🔊 Amazon Alexa - For Visually Impaired</h2><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:8px">Just speak & hear — No typing needed. Alexa will read books for you.<br><br><b>How to use:</b><br>1. Say: "Alexa, open KitabVerse"<br>2. Say: "Search Ramayana in Hindi"<br>3. Alexa will speak book details + Braille output</p><div style="margin-top:14px;padding:12px;background:rgba(212,175,55,0.1);border-radius:10px"><b style="font-size:12px">🎙 Try Now (Alexa Voice Simulation):</b><br><input id="alexaInput" placeholder="Say: Search The Alchemist" style="width:100%;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#070c1e;color:#fff;border:1px solid #333;margin-top:8px"><button onclick="alexaSearch()" style="margin-top:8px;background:#00CAFF;border:none;color:#000;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;width:100%">🔊 Ask Alexa</button><p id="alexaResponse" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:#00CAFF"></p></div></div></div>
<div id="scanModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-content"><span class="close" onclick="closeModal('scanModal')">&times;</span><h2>☰ Scan Book</h2><p>Scan Barcode / ISBN - Secured Site Only (Admin Control)</p><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:14px"><button onclick="alert('Camera permission needed - Will open barcode scanner. Secured by Admin.')" style="background:#d4af37;border:none;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:700">📷 Open Camera Scanner</button><input type="text" placeholder="Or enter ISBN / Title..." style="width:100%;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#070c1e;color:#fff;border:1px solid #333;margin-top:12px" oninput="document.getElementById('searchInput').value=this.value;applyFilters()"></div></div></div>
<div id="donorModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-content"><span class="close" onclick="closeModal('donorModal')">&times;</span><h2>👤 Scan Donor</h2><p>Scan Donor QR - Secured</p><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:14px"><button onclick="alert('QR Scanner - Secured by Admin')" style="background:#d4af37;border:none;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:700">📷 Scan QR</button></div></div></div>
<div id="offlineModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-content"><span class="close" onclick="closeModal('offlineModal')">&times;</span><h2>↓ Offline Access</h2><p>Download and read books offline anytime. Secured site - Admin controls offline storage.</p><button onclick="alert('Offline mode enabled - Books cached securely')" style="margin-top:12px;background:#d4af37;border:none;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700">Enable Offline</button></div></div>
<div id="tvModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-content"><span class="close" onclick="closeModal('tvModal')">&times;</span><h2>📺 Cast to TV</h2><p>Stream to your TV with one tap. Works with Chromecast / Fire TV / Smart TV.</p><button onclick="alert('Searching for TV devices...')" style="margin-top:12px;background:#d4af37;border:none;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700">📺 Search TVs</button></div></div>
<div id="dictModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-content"><span class="close" onclick="closeModal('dictModal')">&times;</span><h2>📖 Secure Dictionary</h2><p>Indian & International + Braille - Secured by Admin</p><input id="dictInput" placeholder="Enter word..." style="width:100%;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#070c1e;color:#fff;border:1px solid #333;margin-top:10px"><div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px"><button onclick="handleDict()" style="flex:1;background:#d4af37;border:none;padding:8px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700">Search</button><button onclick="speakText(document.getElementById('dictInput').value)" style="flex:1;background:#070c1e;border:1px solid #d4af37;color:#d4af37;padding:8px;border-radius:10px">🔊 Speak</button></div><div id="dictBraille" style="margin-top:10px;padding:8px;background:#000;border-radius:8px;min-height:30px;font-size:18px"></div></div></div>
<div id="calendarModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-content"><span class="close" onclick="closeModal('calendarModal')">&times;</span><h2>📅 Calendar</h2><div id="calendarDiv" style="margin-top:10px"></div></div></div>
<div id="visitorModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-content"><span class="close" onclick="closeModal('visitorModal')">&times;</span><h2>👁️ Visitor Counter</h2><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:12px"><div style="font-size:36px;color:#d4af37" id="visitorBig">0</div><p>Total Visits to KitabVerse</p><p style="font-size:11px;opacity:.7;margin-top:8px">Secure counting - Admin controlled</p><div style="margin-top:12px;padding:8px;background:rgba(212,175,55,0.1);border-radius:8px;font-size:11px">Today: <span id="todayVisits">1</span> | This Month: <span id="monthVisits">0</span></div></div></div></div>
<div id="aboutModal" class="modal"><div class="modal-content"><span class="close" onclick="closeModal('aboutModal')">&times;</span><h2>About KitabVerse</h2><p>A library for all — Read, Share, Connect, Listen, Touch, Speak. Voice + Braille + Alexa enabled. Secured site with Admin control.</p></div></div>
